    "about_intro": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"vael-about-content\">\n  <div class=\"vael-about-content__block\">\n    <h2 class=\"vael-about-content__heading\">It started with a candle</h2>\n    <p>I've been obsessed with candles for as long as I can remember. When I was 15, I used to spend my pocket money on scented candles and line them up on my windowsill. My mum thought I was crazy. Maybe I was.</p>\n    <p>There was something about that little flame that made everything feel better. A bad day at school, a messy room, winter evenings when it got dark at 5pm. Light a candle and suddenly the world feels a bit more okay.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"vael-about-content__block\">\n    <h2 class=\"vael-about-content__heading\">Then I found candle sand</h2>\n    <p>A couple of years ago, I came across candle sand completely by accident. I was scrolling through Instagram late at night (like you do) and I saw someone pour these tiny wax pearls into a bowl, stick a wick in, and light it. That was it. No jar, no mess, no wasted wax at the bottom that you can never get out.</p>\n    <p>I ordered some straight away. When it arrived, I poured it into an old ceramic bowl I had lying around and lit it up. And honestly? I just sat there staring at it for like 20 minutes thinking \"why doesn't everyone know about this?\"</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"vael-about-content__block\">\n    <h2 class=\"vael-about-content__heading\">So I started Vael</h2>\n    <p>I didn't have a business plan. I didn't have investors or a warehouse. I had my kitchen table, a laptop, and a genuine conviction that candle sand could change the way people think about candles.</p>\n    <p>The first orders I packed myself, between uni assignments and cups of tea. I remember the rush of seeing that first \"You have a new order\" notification. I screamed. My flatmate thought something was wrong.</p>\n    <p>That was not so long ago. And now here we are. Thousands of orders later, I still get that same little buzz every single time.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"vael-about-content__block\">\n    <h2 class=\"vael-about-content__heading\">What I believe in</h2>\n    <p>I believe candles shouldn't be complicated. You shouldn't need to worry about toxic chemicals, or soot covering your ceiling, or burning yourself trying to light a wick at the bottom of a jar.</p>\n    <p>Candle sand is 100% natural, non-toxic, and you can reuse it forever. When the wick burns out, you just pop in a new one. Same sand, brand new candle. Zero waste, zero stress.</p>\n    <p>Every product I sell is something I'd use myself. Actually, I do use it myself. Every single day.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"vael-about-content__block vael-about-content__block--cta\">\n    <p>Thanks for being here. It really does mean the world.</p>\n    <p class=\"vael-about-content__signature\">- Vael x</p>\n    <a href=\"/collections/all\" class=\"vael-about-content__btn\">SHOP THE COLLECTION</a>\n  </div>\n</div>",
